# Build context exclusions for the Containerfile (read by `container build`, Podman/Buildah and
# Docker BuildKit alike). Secrets and local state never enter the image.
.env
.env.*
**/*.env
*.pem
*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
private
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude
.git
.github
.venv
.vscode
.idea
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.import_linter_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov
**/__pycache__
build
dist
media
staticfiles
node_modules
var
docs
tests
tools
*.md
.pre-commit-config.yaml
# deploy/container (the entry point) and, read-only under /app/deploy, the release's own Quadlet
# units, Caddyfile, mpmv-deploy and env examples (ARC.23: the server installs the units of the tag
# it runs). They hold no secrets. No `!` re-includes: the `container build` context transfer
# rejects them ("changes out of order").
deploy/ci
deploy/local
deploy/README.md
